{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55243","headline":"贻友生 · 徐巡官","name":"贻友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗道长年乐，生来贫却闲。\n（均见宋龚鼎臣《东原录》引李崧《论诗答徐巡官》引。\n）（按：李崧事迹，详《旧五代史》卷一○八，《全唐文》及陆辑二书均失收此文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐巡官","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}